.TH CWE-287 7 "2026-11-15" "CWE Top 25 (2025)" "Software Weakness Reference"
.SH NAME
CWE\-287 \- Improper Authentication
.SH RANK
KEV\-referenced weakness. Not part of the 2025 CWE Top 25; documented here because it appears in the CISA KEV catalog.
.SH CLASSIFICATION
Class: KEV\-referenced weakness.
.SH DESCRIPTION
When an actor claims to have a given identity, the product does not prove or insufficiently proves that the claim is correct.
.SH KNOWN EXPLOITED VULNERABILITIES
